WEBVTT

00:03:56.584 --> 00:04:00.743
dok hrabri ulaze u ring i u sukob

00:04:00.743 --> 00:04:03.388
i okrvavljeni i prljavi padaju

00:04:03.388 --> 00:04:05.224
iznova i iznova i iznova,

00:04:05.224 --> 00:04:07.660
ali nisu sramežljivi i nisu uplašeni,

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.744
već žive život hrabro."

00:04:10.744 --> 00:04:13.392
I tako, naravno, ja želim preko.

00:04:13.392 --> 00:04:17.128
To je cilj, i biću toliko plitka da kažem

00:04:17.128 --> 00:04:20.594
da ove godine, cilj je bio čak slađi

00:04:20.594 --> 00:04:22.711
nego putovanje.

00:04:22.781 --> 00:04:27.357
(Smeh)
(Aplauz)

00:04:27.357 --> 00:04:30.639
Ali i put sam po sebi
je vredan preduzimanja.